   "properties": {
    "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
   },
   "widgets_values": [
    "## Edit anchors with Qwen Image 2.1\n\n1. Select a video, set its crop and size, and move the two anchor markers. Enter the change in **Edit instruction**.\n2. **Run** to generate both Qwen previews. **Ripple Output** starts muted. Check that both edits preserve the framing and apply the same change.\n3. Select **Ripple Output** and press **Ctrl+M**, or choose **Mode → Always**. Run again to generate the video. ComfyUI can reuse unchanged Qwen outputs from its cache.\n\nKeep both Qwen seeds fixed. Anchor sockets follow marker IDs when markers cross on the timeline. For one anchor, remove marker 2 and disconnect or mute its editor branch.\n\nSelect the required local model files in the loader nodes. The image editors use Qwen Image 2.1, its Qwen3-VL 8B text encoder and its VAE. Keep the image encoder's resolution at 0 to preserve the prepared frame size."
   ],
   "title": "Read me"
  },
